# Startup Performance

Tracks avatar server startup time. Goal: warm <10s, cold <1min.

Hardware: g6e.xlarge (4 vCPU, 1x NVIDIA L40S 48GB), CUDA 12.8, Ubuntu 22.04 container.
Storage: EBS gp3 (default: 3,000 IOPS / 125 MB/s throughput).

---

