## Key Observation

Docker restart WITHOUT GPU instance restart still takes 8s for model load.
This confirms: the bottleneck is **EBS read throughput**, not GPU init.
The Linux page cache is cold after container restart (new PID namespace),
so the kernel re-reads model files from EBS even if the instance stayed up.

