Cold start = no avatar cache exists. Must process raw video into render-ready cache.
Target: **~7min 15s → <1min**.

### Current cold start breakdown — ~435s total

| # | Phase | Duration | % | Bottleneck | What it does |
|---|-------|----------|---|-----------|--------------|
