- Modal is a managed platform — can't self-host, vendor lock-in
- No WebRTC support in Modal's serverless model (persistent connections required)
- Cost at scale: Modal charges per-second GPU time; our 2-session-per-GPU model is cheaper

**The right play:** Watch Modal's blog for when NVIDIA open-sources the full checkpoint
toolchain (it's trending that way — cuda-checkpoint repo is public). When driver 580+
is standard on AWS AMIs and CRIU integration stabilizes, build our own version.

